  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Stir in jasmine rice, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all water is absorbed, 10-15 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114ba901acc95ba20f4944/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Grate carrot. Roughly chop Asian greens. Chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook the corn, broccoli, carrot and sesame seeds until lightly browned, 5-6 mins.\n• In the last 2 minutes of cooking, add Asian greens and the remaining garlic to the pan until just wilted. Season to taste. Transfer to the plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114ba901acc95ba20f4944/step-7b41ae11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks. In a small bowl combine soy sauce, brown sugar, rice wine vinegar, ginger paste, sweet chilli sauce, a pinch of pepper and a splash of water.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Add sauce mixture, tossing to coat until thickened, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114ba901acc95ba20f4944/step-bca51565.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice, tofu, Asian greens, corn and carrot between bowls.\n• Spoon over any glaze from pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63114ba901acc95ba20f4944/step-c16a16e5.jpg"
    }
  ]
